    "detailed_description": "Join Inky &amp; Blinky and all their friends in this addictive little puzzle game where your goal is to get Blinky back to Inky. These two are always getting lost in the woods. With the help of Oswald the owl, Stanley the shroom and Harriet the hibiscus, slide Blinky around to connect with Inky. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe have endless auto generated levels for you to tease and tickle that grey matter in our black and white world. I'm sure you can eventually connect these two friends, but can you do it in as little moves as possible?",
